---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="The Remnant — Newsletter" description="Breadcrumbs for the narrow gate. A bi-weekly letter for the lost, the wayward, the afraid, and the ones who never knew they'd drifted.">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="pt-16 pb-8 sm:pt-20 sm:pb-10 bg-black">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center max-w-3xl">
      <div class="fade-in">
        <span class="text-red text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] block mb-6">The Remnant</span>
        <h1 class="mb-6">There Is Still a Path. This Is How You Find It.</h1>
        <p class="text-muted text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          For the lost, the wayward, the afraid, and the ones who never knew they'd drifted.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="divider mx-auto my-6"></div>

  <!-- Breadcrumbs to the Narrow Gate -->
  <section class="py-8 sm:py-10 bg-black">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-2xl fade-in">
      <h2 class="text-center mb-8">Breadcrumbs to the Narrow Gate</h2>
      <div class="space-y-6 text-cream text-lg leading-[1.85]">
        <p>
          The Remnant is not a letter of condemnation. It is an outstretched hand.
        </p>
        <p>
          It is for the pastor who knows he should preach the difficult texts but hasn't found the courage yet. For the young disciple who is passionate and sincere — and doesn't yet know that some of what he's been taught falls short of the whole counsel of God. For the believer who feels the unease of a Sunday morning that asks nothing of them. For the wayward, the searching, the ones who walked away and aren't sure what they walked toward.
        </p>
        <p>
          This is not about being right. It is about being found. Every issue follows a single thread — one idea, one passage, one moment of honest reckoning — and lays it down like breadcrumbs on a path that is narrow, old, and still open.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="divider mx-auto my-6"></div>

  <!-- Every Other Week -->
  <section class="py-8 sm:py-10 bg-black">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-2xl fade-in">
      <h2 class="text-center mb-8">Every Other Week. No Filler.</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-5 text-cream text-lg leading-[1.85]">
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="text-red font-bold mt-0.5">•</span>
          <span>Rooted in Scripture — anchored to what does not change</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="text-red font-bold mt-0.5">•</span>
          <span>Written for wherever you are — not just where you should be</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="text-red font-bold mt-0.5">•</span>
          <span>No condemnation — only the truth, offered with both hands</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pull Quote -->
  <section class="py-10 sm:py-14 bg-black">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center max-w-3xl fade-in">
      <blockquote>
        <p class="text-xl sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl font-heading text-cream italic leading-snug mb-6">
          "The narrow gate is not locked. It is simply unpopular. That does not mean it is closed to you."
        </p>
        <cite class="text-muted text-sm not-italic">
          — Drew Reitzel, <em>You Can't Serve Two Masters</em>
        </cite>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="divider mx-auto my-6"></div>

  <!-- Subscribe -->
  <section class="py-8 sm:py-10 pb-16 sm:pb-20 bg-black">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center max-w-2xl fade-in">
      <h2 class="mb-3">Join The Remnant</h2>
      <p class="text-muted text-lg mb-6">Free. Bi-weekly. Unfiltered.</p>
      <div class="flex justify-center">
        <form
          action="https://app.beehiiv.com/subscribe"
          method="POST"
          target="_blank"
          class="beehiiv-form"
        >
          <input type="hidden" name="publication_id"
            value="c3ad021c-2a0f-40d3-9b52-2058dd05b6a5" />
          <input
            type="email"
            name="email"
            placeholder="Enter your email"
            required
            class="beehiiv-input"
          />
          <button type="submit" class="beehiiv-btn">Subscribe</button>
        </form>
      </div>
      <a
        href="https://app.beehiiv.com/p/the-remnant"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-block mt-4 text-muted text-sm hover:text-cream hover:underline transition-colors"
      >
        Read past issues &rarr;
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .beehiiv-form {
      display: flex;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 560px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .beehiiv-input {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 0;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      background: #1A1A1A;
      border: 1px solid #333;
      border-right: none;
      color: #F5F0E8;
      font-family: Inter, sans-serif;
      font-size: 14px;
      outline: none;
    }
    .beehiiv-btn {
      padding: 14px 24px;
      background: #B41E1E;
      color: #F5F0E8;
      border: none;
      font-family: Inter, sans-serif;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      white-space: nowrap;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
